{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10311","headline":"锡杖歌送明楚上人归佛川 · 皇甫曾","name":"锡杖歌送明楚上人归佛川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上人远自西天至，头陀行遍南朝寺。\n口翻贝叶古字经，手持金策声泠泠。\n护法护身惟振锡，石濑云溪深寂寂。\n乍来松径风露寒，遥暎霜天月成魄。\n後夜空山禅诵时，寥寥挂在枯树枝。\n真法尝传心不住，东西南北随缘路。\n佛川此去何时回，应真莫便游天台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}